WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:04.170
CMU has a lot of different dining halls
that students can choose from.

2
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.707
There's a variety of different cuisines,
such as Mediterranean,

3
00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.710
American, Asian American
and Mexican American,

4
00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:13.747
and they have a lot of different options
that students can choose from.

5
00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:17.784
Every year the dining plan seems to get better
and the options seem to grow.

6
00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.321
Recently, we added a ramen bar

7
00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:25.125
as well as a new smoothie
place in the Highmark Wellness Center.

8
00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:30.163
My favorite place to get food on campus
was ABP, located in Skibo Café.

9
00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.500
I always loved getting their
BBQ chicken sandwich

10
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.368
and sometimes getting a sweet
treat throughout the day.

